  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0007_da71c5273ddc.png\" style=\"width: 392px; height: 200px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced></mrow><mi>h</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>h</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>So, it is not differentiable at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>.</p><p>Similarly, it is not differentiable at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> but it is continuous at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>.</p>"
